{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_372A60","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，去追那辆载着核弹头的卡车。首先，从设有收容设施的村子向北穿过去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"要从村子北边出去，就必须摧毁闸门。需要炸药。拜托你了，Snake！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""}]}